  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000pzf4](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000pzf4) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 51.973 depth occurred on Mar 17 2025 21km NE of Sarulla. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 1.9622 longitude 99.1816. It impacted 405729 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
